sends an IPv6 multicast listener discovery (MLD) query packet to‐
ward  the  specified  multicast  address, toward interface If you
omit linklocal all nodes multicast address(ff02::1) is used.  Af‐
ter sending a query, waits for replies for at  most  10  seconds.
If  a  reply  is returned, prints it with its type and then waits
for another reply.  This program is provided only for  debugging.
It  is not necessary for normal use.  With will transmit MLD done
packet instead of MLD query packet.  With similarly,  MLD  report
packet  will  be transmitted.  options are for debugging purposes
only.  The command first  appeared  in  WIDE/KAME  IPv6  protocol
stack  kit.  does not take care of multicast addresses which have
non link‐local scope.
